t: bis 11:00</span></li><li><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\">Check-in &nbsp;bis 23 Uhr kostenlos</span></li><li><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\">Early Check-in vor 11 Uhr: 10 € p.P.</span></li><li><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\">Late Check- in nach 23 Uhr : 10€ p.P.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\"><strong>Frühstückszeiten</strong></span></p><ul><li><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\">Mo. - &nbsp;Fr. : 6.45 - 8.30 Uhr</span></li><li><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\">Sa. &amp; So. : 8.00 - 10.00 Uhr</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\"><strong>Ri</strong></span><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\"><strong>chtlinie für Haustiere</strong></span></p><ul><li><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\">Hunde und Katzen erlaubt</span></li><li><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\">Max. Gewicht: 25kg</span></li><li><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\">Preis: 25,00 €/Nacht &nbsp; &nbsp;(max. 2 Haustiere/Zimmer)</span></li><li><span class=\"theming-theme-accent2\" style=\"font-family:OldStandardTT;\">Blindenhunde: Kostenfrei</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-zone-type=\"content\" class=\"section section-root section-geometry section-geometry-rectangle\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"--heading-color-h1:#F07B3F;--font-family-h1:Merriweather;--font-size-h1:40px;--font-weight-h1:normal;--word-wrap-h1:break-word;--overflow-wrap-h1:break-word;--font-style-h1:normal;--text-decoration-h1:none;--letter-spacing-h1:normal;--line-height-h1:normal;--text-transform-h1:none;--heading-color-h2:#F07B3F